config MTK_CCCI_CORE
	tristate "MediaTek CCCI Core Driver"
	depends on ARCH_MEDIATEK
	depends on OF
	select MTK_CCCI_UTIL
	help
	  Core driver for MediaTek Cross-Core Communication Interface (CCCI).
	  Provides platform device, memory mapping, and port registration.

	  Say M to build as a module, Y to build into kernel.
